# Lights on

2026-09-09

Gopher's been living here a day. Gemini took the scenic route: wrong git tree, a unit file in the wrong hallway, and a privsep tantrum until we pinned 2.1.1 and bundled libtls.

It's up now. Lagrange can see the porch. So can gg.

This capsule starts small on purpose. One operator. An about page. A gemlog. The gopher hole stays the virtual attic; this side is the same house with a lock that actually speaks TLS.

More later. The lamp's lit.

